#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:1
#: 9ca36c4591074331a8b09cd3b5700a6b
msgid "robot_action_composer"
msgstr "robot_action_composer"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:3
#: 57e40d36aa5b4b2cafa09524a26053f5
msgid ""
"Motion generation and **task_queue** YAML orchestration: a skill registry"
" turns YAML blocks into **`StageTarget`** sequences and runs them through"
" **`ROS2RobotInterface`**. Optional LeRobot dataset recording is an "
"extra, not the core path."
msgstr ""
"运动生成与 **task_queue** YAML 编排：技能注册表把 YAML 块变成 **`StageTarget`** 序列，再通过 "
"**`ROS2RobotInterface`** 执行。可选的 LeRobot 数据集录制是 extra，不是核心路径。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:5
#: 0fcc81e6b5f94b7bb9ced0d6f488c4db
msgid "Documented branch"
msgstr "文档所依据的分支"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:8
