msgid ""
"Documented against branch `feature/dex-grasp-generator` (tip 2026-09-20)."
" That branch is newer than `main`; follow it, not `main`."
msgstr ""
"本文档对照分支 `feature/dex-grasp-generator`（尖端提交 2026-09-20）。该分支新于 "
"`main`；请以它为准，不要跟 `main`。"

